        <profileDesc>
            <creation/>
            <abstract>
                <p>It is a collection of ten anonymous miracles of varying length all said to have
                    occurred as a result of the recitation of the hymn <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4031EgziabeherN">ʾƎgziʾabǝḥer nagśa (Zarʾa Yāʿqob)</ref>, to which it is appended in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BNFabb211">Paris, Bibliothèque nationale de France, BnF Éthiopien d'Abbadie 211</ref>. The work is prefaced with the abjuration formula
                        (<foreign xml:lang="gez">በቅድስት፡ ሥላሴ፡ እንዘ፡ ኣአምን፡ ወእትመሐፀን፡…</foreign>)
                    frequently encountered in works associated with <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10626ZaraY">Zarʾa Yāʿqob</persName>.
                    Eight of the first miracles were first translated in French in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/MYRJ6FIB"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Grebaut1931aMiracles"/><title level="a">Les miracles attribués a L'&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;ʾEgziʾabeḥêr nagša&lt;/hi&gt;</title><title level="j">Aethiops : Bulletin Geʿez</title><author><forename>Sylvain</forename><surname>Grébaut</surname></author><date>1931</date><biblScope unit="volume">4me année</biblScope><biblScope unit="issue">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">11–13</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Grebaut1931aMiracles</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Grebaut1931aMiracles</note></bibl>
                    <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/A2MS5MP8"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Grebaut1931bMiracles"/><title level="a">Les miracles attribués a L'&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;ʾEgziʾabeḥêr nagša&lt;/hi&gt; (Suite)</title><title level="j">Aethiops : Bulletin Geʿez</title><author><forename>Sylvain</forename><surname>Grébaut</surname></author><date>1931</date><biblScope unit="volume">4me année</biblScope><biblScope unit="issue">2</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">17–20</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Grebaut1931bMiracles</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Grebaut1931bMiracles</note></bibl>and then reproduced in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/K23IJTJW"><seg type="journalArticle"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Grebaut1934Miracles"/><title level="a">Les miracles attribués au cantique &lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;ʾEgziʾabeḥêr nagśa&lt;/hi&gt;</title><title level="j">Aethiopica : revue philologique</title><author><forename>Sylvain</forename><surname>Grébaut</surname></author><date>1934</date><biblScope unit="volume">IIe année</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">10–15</biblScope><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Grebaut1934Miracles</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Grebaut1934Miracles</note></bibl> following the text in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BNFabb211">Paris, Bibliothèque nationale de France, BnF Éthiopien d'Abbadie 211</ref>.</p>
